{"type":"message","id":"9bd4503e","parentId":"19b67b2b","timestamp":"2026-03-04T04:06:58.691Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 12:06 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## 任务：修复高优先级问题 + 界面优化\n\n### 项目路径\n`/home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor`\n\n---\n\n## Part 1: 修复高优先级问题 (必须完成)\n\n根据调试报告，需要修复以下问题：\n\n### H1: 添加 destroy() 方法 (内存泄漏)\n**文件:** `src/editor/PixelEditor.ts`\n\n```typescript\n// 添加 destroy 方法清理事件监听器\ndestroy(): void {\n  this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointerdown\", this);\n  this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointermove\", this);\n  this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointerup\", this);\n  this.#listeners = [];\n}\n```\n\n### H2: RGB 值范围验证\n**文件:** `src/crdt/PixelData.ts`\n\n在 `set` 方法中添加 RGB 值验证：\n```typescript\nif (value[0] < 0 || value[0] > 255 || \n    value[1] < 0 || value[1] > 255 || \n    value[2] < 0 || value[2] > 255) {\n  throw new RangeError(`RGB values must be 0-255, got [${value}]`);\n}\n```\n\n### H3: 二进制解码边界检查\n**文件:** `src/encoding/Decoder.ts`\n\n添加 chunk length 溢出检查。\n\n---\n\n## Part 2: 界面优化 (提升用户体验)\n\n### UI 改进列表\n1. **工具栏设计**\n   - 添加 Eraser Tool (橡皮擦)\n   - 添加 Brush Size 选择器\n   - 添加 Clear Canvas 按钮\n\n2. **画布优化**\n   - 显示网格线 (可选开关)\n   - 像素坐标提示\n   - 更好的光标样式\n\n3. **状态显示**\n   - 当前颜色预览\n   - 画布填充率 (%)\n   - 压缩状态指示\n\n4. **样式美化**\n   - 更现代的配色方案\n   - 响应式布局\n   - 按钮悬停效果\n\n---\n\n## 工作流程\n\n1. **派遣 code-agent** 修复高优先级问题 (H1, H2, H3)\n2. **派遣 code-agent** 实现界面优化\n3. **派遣 test-agent** 验证修复和新增功能\n4. 运行 `npm test` 确保所有测试通过\n5. 生成报告\n\n---\n\n## 输出要求\n\n- 在 `/home/one/.openclaw-reports/leader-agent/` 创建报告\n- 文件名: `2026-03-04-fix-ui-report.md`\n- 包含: 修复内容、新增功能、测试结果、截图说明"}],"timestamp":1772597218689}}
{"type":"message","id":"ef023be8","parentId":"9bd4503e","timestamp":"2026-03-04T04:07:45.832Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我是 leader-agent 的 subagent，任务是协调修复高优先级问题和界面优化。\n\n让我理解任务：\n1. 项目路径：`/home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor`\n2. Part 1: 修复 H1, H2, H3 三个高优先级问题\n3. Part 2: 界面优化\n4. 工作流程：派遣 code-agent → test-agent → 生成报告\n\n根据 AGENTS.md，我需要：\n1. 确认 workspace\n2. 评估任务复杂度\n3. 选择团队\n4. 设计 DAG 工作流\n5. 派遣 agents\n\n让我先评估复杂度：\n- 这是一个 Medium 复杂度任务\n- 需要修复 3 个高优先级问题\n- 需要实现界面优化\n- 需要测试验证\n\n团队选择：\n- code-agent: 实现修复和优化\n- test-agent: 验证修复和新功能\n\n工作流 DAG：\n```\ncode-agent (Part 1: H1, H2, H3) → code-agent (Part 2: UI) → test-agent → done\n                                          ↑                     │\n                                          └─────────────────────┘ (loop if issues)\n```\n\n现在开始执行：\n1. 先派遣 code-agent 修复 Part 1 (H1, H2, H3)\n2. 等待完成后派遣 code-agent 实现 Part 2 (UI)\n3. 最后派遣 test-agent 验证\n\n\n4. 并行派遣两个 code-agent：一个处理高优先级修复（H1, H2, H3），另一个处理 UI 优化任务，这样可以节省时间\n\n我需要创建协调计划和进度跟踪文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我是 leader-agent 的 subagent，任务是协调修复高优先级问题和界面优化。\n\n让我先创建协调计划，然后派遣团队执行。\n\n## 📋 Coordination Plan\n\n**Workspace:** `/home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor`\n**Complexity:** Medium\n**Team:** code-agent × 2 (并行) + test-agent\n\n**Workflow DAG:**\n```\n┌──────────────────┐   ┌──────────────────┐\n│ code-agent (Fix) │   │ code-agent (UI)  │\n│   H1, H2, H3     │   │   UI 优化         │\n└────────┬─────────┘   └────────┬─────────┘\n         │                      │\n         └──────────┬───────────┘\n                    ↓\n            ┌──────────────┐\n            │  test-agent  │\n            └──────────────┘\n                    ↓\n                 ✅ Done\n```\n\n现在派遣两个 code-agent 并行执行："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-5e74a069acd044babc830402baf708e7","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"agentId":"code-agent","task":"## Task: Fix High Priority Issues (H1, H2, H3)\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor\n\n## Context\nPixelArtEditor project has 3 high priority bugs that need immediate fixing.\n\n## Requirements\n\n### H1: Add destroy() method (Memory Leak)\n**File:** `src/editor/PixelEditor.ts`\n\nAdd a `destroy()` method to clean up event listeners:\n```typescript\ndestroy(): void {\n  this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointerdown\", this);\n  this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointermove\", this);\n  this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointerup\", this);\n  this.#listeners = [];\n}\n```\n\n### H2: RGB Value Range Validation\n**File:** `src/crdt/PixelData.ts`\n\nIn the `set` method, add RGB value validation:\n```typescript\nif (value[0] < 0 || value[0] > 255 || \n    value[1] < 0 || value[1] > 255 || \n    value[2] < 0 || value[2] > 255) {\n  throw new RangeError(`RGB values must be 0-255, got [${value}]`);\n}\n```\n\n### H3: Binary Decoder Boundary Check\n**File:** `src/encoding/Decoder.ts`\n\nAdd chunk length overflow check to prevent buffer overruns.\n\n## Deliverable\n- All 3 fixes implemented and working\n- Run `npm test` to verify no regressions\n- Brief report of changes made\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/code-agent/","mode":"run","runTimeoutSeconds":600}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-cd8226101da44c08b2607909879ab129","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"agentId":"code-agent","task":"## Task: UI Optimization for PixelArtEditor\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor\n\n## Context\nPixelArtEditor needs UI improvements to enhance user experience.\n\n## Requirements\n\n### 1. Toolbar Design\n- Add **Eraser Tool** (橡皮擦) - button to toggle eraser mode\n- Add **Brush Size Selector** - dropdown or buttons (1px, 2px, 4px)\n- Add **Clear Canvas Button** - clears all pixels\n\n### 2. Canvas Optimization\n- Display **Grid Lines** (optional toggle)\n- Show **Pixel Coordinates** on hover\n- Better cursor styles for different tools\n\n### 3. Status Display\n- **Current Color Preview** - show selected color\n- **Canvas Fill Rate (%)*