{"type":"message","id":"ca86d4ce","parentId":"6e3b3b77","timestamp":"2026-03-04T04:20:02.543Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-b4483ebba0a44df9a5876f39b66a5c92","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 24\ndrwxrwxr-x 5 one one 4096 Mar  4 10:31 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 6 one one 4096 Mar  4 12:13 ..\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Mar  4 10:31 crdt\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Mar  4 10:32 editor\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Mar  4 10:39 encoding\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one  704 Mar  4 10:31 types.ts\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Collaborative Pixel Art Editor with CRDTs</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"app-container\">\n    <header class=\"header\">\n      <h1>🎨 Pixel Art Editor</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Built with CRDTs - Conflict-free Replicated Data Types</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Toolbar -->\n    <div class=\"toolbar\">\n      <div class=\"toolbar-section\">\n        <div class=\"tool-group\">\n          <button id=\"pencilTool\" class=\"tool-btn active\" title=\"Pencil Tool (P)\">\n            <span class=\"tool-icon\">✏️</span>\n            <span class=\"tool-label\">Pencil</span>\n          </button>\n          <button id=\"eraserTool\" class=\"tool-btn\" title=\"Eraser Tool (E)\">\n            <span class=\"tool-icon\">🧽</span>\n            <span class=\"tool-label\">Eraser</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"tool-group brush-size-group\">\n          <label class=\"tool-label\">Brush:</label>\n          <div class=\"brush-sizes\">\n            <button id=\"brush1px\" class=\"brush-btn active\" data-size=\"1\" title=\"1px\">1px</button>\n            <button id=\"brush2px\" class=\"brush-btn\" data-size=\"2\" title=\"2px\">2px</button>\n            <button id=\"brush4px\" class=\"brush-btn\" data-size=\"4\" title=\"4px\">4px</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"tool-group\">\n          <label class=\"tool-label\">Color:</label>\n          <input type=\"color\" id=\"color\" value=\"#000000\" class=\"color-picker\">\n          <div id=\"colorPreview\" class=\"color-preview\" style=\"background-color: #000000;\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"toolbar-section\">\n        <button id=\"toggleGrid\" class=\"tool-btn\" title=\"Toggle Grid (G)\">\n          <span class=\"tool-icon\">⊞</span>\n          <span class=\"tool-label\">Grid</span>\n        </button>\n        <button id=\"clearCanvas\" class=\"tool-btn danger\" title=\"Clear Canvas\">\n          <span class=\"tool-icon\">🗑️</span>\n          <span class=\"tool-label\">Clear</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Status Bar -->\n    <div class=\"status-bar\">\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <span class=\"status-label\">Cursor:</span>\n        <span id=\"cursorCoords\" class=\"status-value\">-</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <span class=\"status-label\">Fill Rate:</span>\n        <span id=\"fillRate\" class=\"status-value\">0%</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <span class=\"status-label\">Compression:</span>\n        <span id=\"compressionStatus\" class=\"status-value\">Ready</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <label class=\"toggle-label\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"network\" checked>\n          <span class=\"toggle-slider\"></span>\n          <span class=\"toggle-text\">Network Online</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <label class=\"slider-label\">\n          <span>Latency:</span>\n          <input type=\"range\" id=\"latency\" min=\"0\" max=\"2000\" value=\"0\" step=\"100\">\n          <span id=\"latencyValue\">0</span>ms\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Canvases -->\n    <div class=\"canvases\">\n      <div class=\"canvas-container\">\n        <h2>Alice</h2>\n        <div class=\"canvas-wrapper\">\n          <canvas id=\"alice\" class=\"canvas\"></canvas>\n          <canvas id=\"aliceGrid\" class=\"grid-canvas\"></canvas>\n          <canvas id=\"aliceOverlay\" class=\"overlay-canvas\"></canvas>\n        </div>"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":7,"aggregated":"total 24\ndrwxrwxr-x 5 one one 4096 Mar  4 10:31 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 6 one one 4096 Mar  4 12:13 ..\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Mar  4 10:31 crdt\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Mar  4 10:32 editor\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Mar  4 10:39 encoding\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one  704 Mar  4 10:31 types.ts\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Collaborative Pixel Art Editor with CRDTs</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"app-container\">\n    <header class=\"header\">\n      <h1>🎨 Pixel Art Editor</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Built with CRDTs - Conflict-free Replicated Data Types</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Toolbar -->\n    <div class=\"toolbar\">\n      <div class=\"toolbar-section\">\n        <div class=\"tool-group\">\n          <button id=\"pencilTool\" class=\"tool-btn active\" title=\"Pencil Tool (P)\">\n            <span class=\"tool-icon\">✏️</span>\n            <span class=\"tool-label\">Pencil</span>\n          </button>\n          <button id=\"eraserTool\" class=\"tool-btn\" title=\"Eraser Tool (E)\">\n            <span class=\"tool-icon\">🧽</span>\n            <span class=\"tool-label\">Eraser</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"tool-group brush-size-group\">\n          <label class=\"tool-label\">Brush:</label>\n          <div class=\"brush-sizes\">\n            <button id=\"brush1px\" class=\"brush-btn active\" data-size=\"1\" title=\"1px\">1px</button>\n            <button id=\"brush2px\" class=\"brush-btn\" data-size=\"2\" title=\"2px\">2px</button>\n            <button id=\"brush4px\" class=\"brush-btn\" data-size=\"4\" title=\"4px\">4px</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"tool-group\">\n          <label class=\"tool-label\">Color:</label>\n          <input type=\"color\" id=\"color\" value=\"#000000\" class=\"color-picker\">\n          <div id=\"colorPreview\" class=\"color-preview\" style=\"background-color: #000000;\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"toolbar-section\">\n        <button id=\"toggleGrid\" class=\"tool-btn\" title=\"Toggle Grid (G)\">\n          <span class=\"tool-icon\">⊞</span>\n          <span class=\"tool-label\">Grid</span>\n        </button>\n        <button id=\"clearCanvas\" class=\"tool-btn danger\" title=\"Clear Canvas\">\n          <span class=\"tool-icon\">🗑️</span>\n          <span class=\"tool-label\">Clear</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Status Bar -->\n    <div class=\"status-bar\">\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <span class=\"status-label\">Cursor:</span>\n        <span id=\"cursorCoords\" class=\"status-value\">-</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <span class=\"status-label\">Fill Rate:</span>\n        <span id=\"fillRate\" class=\"status-value\">0%</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <span class=\"status-label\">Compression:</span>\n        <span id=\"compressionStatus\" class=\"status-value\">Ready</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <label class=\"toggle-label\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"network\" checked>\n          <span class=\"toggle-slider\"></span>\n          <span class=\"toggle-text\">Network Online</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status-item\">\n        <label class=\"slider-label\">\n          <span>Latency:</span>\n          <input type=\"range\" id=\"latency\" min=\"0\" max=\"2000\" value=\"0\" step=\"100\">\n          <span id=\"latencyValue\">0</span>ms\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Canvases -->\n    <div class=\"canvases\">\n      <div class=\"canvas-container\">\n        <h2>Alice</h2>\n        <div class=\"canvas-wrapper\">\n          <canvas id=\"alice\" class=\"canvas\"></canvas>\n          <canvas id=\"aliceGrid\" class=\"grid-canvas\"></canvas>\n          <canvas id=\"aliceOverlay\" class=\"overlay-canvas\"></canvas>\n        </div>","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772598002541}}
{"type":"message","id":"0f160fa6","parentId":"ca86d4ce","timestamp":"2026-03-04T04:20:09.733Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good - the UI implementation seems to be done! The index.html has all the UI elements:\n- Eraser Tool button\n- Brush Size buttons (1px, 2px, 4px)\n- Clear Canvas button\n- Grid toggle\n- Cursor coordinates display\n- Fill rate display\n- Compression status\n\nLet me check the UI report and the PixelEditor.ts for destroy() method:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"UI 实现已完成！让我检查 UI 报告并确认 H1 destroy() 的状态："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-4e66ecd7527f4a72b1b7889410d17c06","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw-reports/code-agent/2026-03-04-pixelart-ui-optimization.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-994453e93f2e48b5a24d1b90fc78c935","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor && grep -n \"destroy\" src/editor/PixelEditor.ts || echo \"destroy() NOT FOUND - need to add\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":1462,"output":261,"cacheRead":25497,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27220,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772598002543}}
{"type":"message","id":"7344ebaf","parentId":"0f160fa6","timestamp":"2026-03-04T04:20:09.738Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-4e66ecd7527f4a72b1b7889410d17c06","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Development Report\n\n**Date:** 2026-03-04\n**Task:** UI Optimization for PixelArtEditor\n**Agent:** code-agent\n\n## Workspace\n`/home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor`\n\n## Files Changed\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `index.html` | Complete UI overhaul with new toolbar, status bar, grid/overlay canvases, keyboard shortcuts |\n| `style.css` | Modern color scheme with CSS variables, responsive design, hover effects, animations |\n| `main.ts` | Added UI handlers for tools, brush sizes, grid toggle, clear canvas, keyboard shortcuts |\n| `src/editor/PixelEditor.ts` | Added eraser mode, brush size support, grid overlay, coordinate tracking, fill rate calculation, clear method |\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\n### 1. Toolbar Design ✅\n- **Eraser Tool** - Toggle button with eraser icon, switches between draw/erase mode\n- **Brush Size Selector** - Three buttons (1px, 2px, 4px) with visual active state\n- **Clear Canvas Button** - Button with trash icon and confirmation dialog\n\n### 2. Canvas Optimization ✅\n- **Grid Lines** - Optional toggle with smooth fade-in/out animation using separate grid canvas layer\n- **Pixel Coordinates** - Real-time cursor coordinates displayed in status bar on hover\n- **Cursor Styles** - Different cursor styles for pencil (crosshair) and eraser (cell) modes\n- **Brush Preview** - Highlight overlay shows affected pixels for brush size\n\n### 3. Status Display ✅\n- **Current Color Preview** - Shows selected color in a small swatch next to color picker\n- **Canvas Fill Rate (%)** - Real-time calculation of non-white pixels as percentage\n- **Compression Status Indicator** - Shows \"Ready\" or \"Compressing...\" with animation\n\n### 4. Style Beautification ✅\n- **Modern Color Scheme** - Dark theme with CSS variables:\n  - Primary: `#0f0f1a` (dark navy)\n  - Secondary: `#1a1a2e` (lighter navy)\n  - Accent: `#6c5ce7` (purple), `#00cec9` (teal), `#ff6b6b` (red)\n- **Responsive Layout** - Flexbox-based layout that adapts to mobile devices\n- **Button Hover Effects** - Smooth transitions, color shifts, slight lift effect\n- **Keyboard Shortcuts** - P (pencil), E (eraser), G (grid), 1/2/3 (brush sizes)\n\n## Technical Details\n\n### New Features in PixelEditor Class\n- `toolMode` property (pencil/eraser)\n- `brushSize` property (1/2/4)\n- `showGrid` property\n- `onCoordChange` callback\n- `onFillRateChange` callback\n- `onCompressionStatus` callback\n- `clear()` method\n- Grid canvas layer with DDA line drawing\n- Overlay canvas for cursor highlight\n- Brush-aware painting with coordinate offsets\n\n### UI Architecture\n- **Three-layer canvas system**: Main drawing canvas, grid overlay (optional), cursor highlight overlay\n- **Event-driven state updates**: Callbacks for coordinate, fill rate, and compression status\n- **CSS-based animations**: Smooth transitions for button states, grid visibility, compression indicator\n\n## Code Notes\n\n### Usage Examples\n\n```typescript\n// Initialize with grid and overlay support\nconst editor = new PixelEditor(canvas, { w: 100, h: 100 }, \"id\", {\n  showGrid: false,\n  gridCanvas: gridCanvas,\n  overlayCanvas: overlayCanvas\n});\n\n// Set callbacks\neditor.onCoordChange = (x, y) => console.log(`Cursor at (${x}, ${y})`);\neditor.onFillRateChange = (rate) => console.log(`Fill rate: ${rate}%`);\neditor.onCompressionStatus = (status) => console.log(`Status: ${status}`);\n\n// Use new features\neditor.toolMode = \"eraser\";\neditor.brushSize = 2;\neditor.showGrid = true;\neditor.clear();\n```\n\n### Important Considerations\n1. **Brush size implementation**: Uses centered offset (halfSize) to center brush on cursor\n2. **Grid performance**: Grid is pre-rendered and toggled via CSS opacity for efficiency\n3. **Fill rate calculation**: Counts non-null pixel entries in CRDT state\n4. **Coordinate display**: Uses separate overlay canvas to avoid redrawing main canvas\n5. **Eraser mode**: Eraser paints with white [255, 255, 255] instead of deleting pixels (preserves CRDT structure)\n\n## Known Limitations\n- Grid lines are fixed at 1-pixel spacing (not configurable)\n- Brush preview shows highlight but doesn't preview actual pixel color\n- No undo/redo functionality (would require additional state management)\n- Fill rate counts all CRDT entries, including erased pixels in history\n- Mobile touch handling not optimized (uses pointer events but may need gestures)\n\n## Next Steps for Team\n- **test-agent:** Test edge cases:\n  - Drawing at canvas boundaries with different brush sizes\n  - Rapid tool switching during active drawing\n  - Grid toggle performance with large artboards\n  - Fill rate accuracy after eraser operations\n- **review-agent:** Review UI/UX:\n  - Button spacing and layout on mobile devices\n  - Color contrast for accessibility\n  - Keyboard shortcut discoverability\n- **design-agent:** Consider future enhancements:\n  - Configurable grid spacing\n  - Additional brush shapes (circle, square)\n  - Color palette with saved colors\n  - Zoom/pan functionality\n\n## Status\n✅ Ready for testing\n\nAll tests passing:\n- 4 test suites passed\n- 42 tests passed\n- Build successful (17.12 kB bundle, 7.43 kB CSS)\n\nDemo available via `npm run dev` or `npm run preview`"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772598009737}}
